      "side": 1,
      "message": "@hao.x.li@intel.com and @jiawei.shao@intel.com, please review this CL as it introduces the generation definition for Intel GPUs, and I also hope to have the most consistency with https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/6860507.\nFor all the enum names in generation definition, I prefixed them with Genxx so that it\u0027s easy to know a number. Maybe it\u0027s hard for Chromium to change accordingly, as they\u0027re already attached to histograms.",
      "revId": "2b17a1d6ed71fdfabd4dd3b509f215e3d48cf28d",
