      "writtenOn": "2025-08-20T12:27:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Aren\u0027t generations the \"marketing\" names for the architectures defined by the vendors? Maybe something like:\n\n```suggestion\n// Some vendors market their architecture with increasing \"generation\" numbers (like Intel Gen11\n// or Adreno 600 series). Map PCI IDs to these as it can be an easy way to detect all the devices\n// before a certain released generation.\n\n// For example returns 11 for Intel Gen 11 devices.\nint GetIntelGen(PCIVendorID venderId, PCIDeviceID deviceId);\n// For example returns 6 for Adreno 600 series devices.\nint GetQualcomm_ACPIGen(PCIVendorID venderId, PCIDeviceID deviceId);\n}  // namespace dawn::gpu_info\n```",
